    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 08 · Inbound WHATSAPP\nTwilio → `/webhook/roofradar/whatsapp` (HTTP Basic auth in the URL: `https://user:pass@your-n8n/webhook/roofradar/whatsapp`).\nReplies `<Response/>` instantly so Twilio never times out.\n**Idempotent:** a retried MessageSid hits the unique index and the run stops.\nOpt-out / opt-in keywords are handled deterministically **before** any AI sees the message.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "aaabd6a9-ec19-4b1e-9bea-d7835bff5ebb",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
